        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer F87464-0910 Spring Hinge Locking Pins and Tension Tool</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged of (1) Tension Rod Adjusting Tool & (2) Locking Pins. For use with <a href=\"/collections/bommer-spring-hinges\"><b>Bommer LB4300 series Single Acting Spring Hinges</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/4-x-4-x-1-4-radius-full-surface-lavatory-door-spring-hinge-bommer-lb1002-400\"><b>Bommer LB1002-400 Lavatory Door Spring Hinges</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe Tension Rod Tool is use to adjust spring tension on a Bommer Spring Hinge. The Locking Pins hold the Spring in tension after it is set.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications </b> for Bommer F87464-0910\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Locking Pin Diameter: .085\"</li>\r\n<li>Locking Pin Length: .625\" (5/8\")</li>\r\n<li>Tension Rod Tool Diameter: .090\"</li>\r\n<li>Tension Rod Tool Length: 3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n *Packaged of (1) Tension Rod Adjusting Tool & (2) Locking Pins.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br><br><br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued. \r\n<br><br><br><br><br><br></b>\r\n</p>",
